### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/auth/auth?username=mono&email=mono@gmail.com&password=19283746

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/auth/login?username=mono&password=19283746

### Get current user (requires Authorization header)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all news
GET http://localhost:8080/api/news?count=10

### Create news (requires Authorization)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/news
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Breaking News",
  "content": "News content here"
}

### Update news (requires Authorization)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/news/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "Updated content"
}

### Delete news (requires Authorization)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/news/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
